    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8370" root="حطأ" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَطِىْءٌ</span></b> , applied to a man, <i>Low, ignoble, mean,</i>
or <i>sordid.</i> (AZ, S, K.) You say also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَطِىْءٌ بَطِىْءٌ</span>,
using the latter word as an imitative sequent. (S.)

